WEBVTT

00:00.567 --> 00:09.424
kanashige ni saku hana ni kimi no omokage wo mita

00:00.567 --> 00:09.424
I saw your image in the flower that is blossoming sorrowfully

00:09.937 --> 00:18.509
daisuki na ame nanoni naze ka kyou wa tsumetakute

00:09.937 --> 00:18.509
I love rain, yet it felt frosty today

00:18.651 --> 00:37.226
kisetsu wa meguri mori wa somerare kaze wa kanadete omoi afurete

00:18.651 --> 00:37.226
The season changed, the forest was colored, the wind played a tune, memories overflowed

00:37.600 --> 00:46.786
tsuki no kakera wo atsumete yume wo kazari nemuru

00:37.600 --> 00:46.787
Gather the pieces of the moon, decorate the dream and sleep

00:47.020 --> 00:56.153
toki no suna chiribametemo ano koro e kaeranai

00:47.020 --> 00:56.154
Even if I sprinkle the sand of time, I cannot return to the past

00:56.313 --> 01:05.420
ikiru imi sageshiteiru dare mo mina tabibito

00:56.313 --> 01:05.420
Those searching for the meaning of life are all travellers

01:05.769 --> 01:14.817
haruka naru tabiji tadori boku wa ima arukidasu

01:05.776 --> 01:14.817
I set my course on this endless journey

01:14.837 --> 01:22.812
ibara no michi no mukou e...

01:14.837 --> 01:22.812
for the place beyond the thorny path...

01:25.785 --> 01:30.705
The artist of life who produces miracles
with his godlike scalpel skills.

01:31.624 --> 01:33.959
The surgeon whom the era has yearned for.

01:34.835 --> 01:35.878
Black Jack.

01:56.396 --> 01:58.563
Michiru-san, it's time for your shot.

01:59.107 --> 02:00.357
What are you drawing?

02:00.900 --> 02:03.610
A house that l'd like to live in.

02:04.320 --> 02:06.786
The inside will be full of bright-colored furniture.

02:07.073 --> 02:08.552
The yard is filled with flowers.

02:08.991 --> 02:11.159
I will invite people every day, and...

02:18.084 --> 02:20.961
You're getting better, Michiru-san.

02:22.547 --> 02:25.349
Doctor, please tell me.

02:25.550 --> 02:28.260
Many more days will I live?

02:29.220 --> 02:31.471
What are you saying all of a sudden?

02:32.515 --> 02:35.350
Doctor, I have cancer, right?

02:37.103 --> 02:38.650
I already knew it.

02:38.896 --> 02:43.316
It's spread all over, and I will never recover, right?

02:43.901 --> 02:45.902
That's not true, Michiru-san.

02:46.362 --> 02:47.988
Your guess is wrong.

02:49.032 --> 02:50.449
Please don't hide it, doctor.

02:51.035 --> 02:53.994
I want to use my remaining time effectively.

02:55.413 --> 02:56.413
Michiru-san...

02:57.123 --> 03:00.292
It's okay to tell me the truth.

03:01.002 --> 03:02.210
Please, doctor!

03:04.797 --> 03:07.716
Two or three weeks left.

03:08.343 --> 03:09.843
One month at most.

03:10.720 --> 03:11.636
I see.

03:12.263 --> 03:13.388
That's rather short.

03:13.723 --> 03:16.850
But Michiru-san, never give up hope.

03:22.896 --> 03:23.702
Hope...

03:30.073 --> 03:32.324
What is my hope?

03:37.038 --> 03:39.331
There's still hope.

03:41.425 --> 03:44.638
Originally by Tezuka Osamu "The Temporary Love"

03:41.425 --> 03:44.638
The Fabricated Wedding

03:45.088 --> 03:47.214
Michiru, tell me anything.

03:47.882 --> 03:50.258
We will get you anything you want.

03:50.323 --> 03:50.923
So tell us.

03:51.283 --> 03:52.172
Anything?

03:52.428 --> 03:53.053
Yes.

03:54.681 --> 03:56.723
Then I want to get married.

03:58.726 --> 04:01.186
I want to experience something happy.

04:01.479 --> 04:04.731
But Michiru, you can't get married alone.

04:04.732 --> 04:06.066
She's right.

04:06.442 --> 04:07.192
You're right.

04:07.610 --> 04:09.444
But all I want is a wedding.

04:09.904 --> 04:11.530
I want to have a wedding.

04:12.448 --> 04:13.949
How about this?

04:14.450 --> 04:19.538
I will marry the first man who walks into this room.

04:20.081 --> 04:21.581
That's reckless...

04:22.083 --> 04:24.126
Isn't it cute, like in a fairytale?

04:25.003 --> 04:27.838
Michiru, that's a bit too much...

04:29.257 --> 04:30.674
That's fine!

04:31.509 --> 04:33.301
I will ask around, too!

04:33.720 --> 04:34.511
Honey!

04:34.887 --> 04:38.890
That's fine, if it makes you happy.

04:40.018 --> 04:43.020
What are you going to do about this?

04:43.021 --> 04:46.064
I had to tell her that.

04:46.065 --> 04:47.065
But..

04:47.316 --> 04:48.150
Aotori-san,

04:49.318 --> 04:50.360
your daughter is...

04:55.368 --> 04:56.611
Michiru!

04:57.869 --> 04:59.161
Hang on!

05:00.663 --> 05:01.246
Mom!

05:01.456 --> 05:02.372
What is it?

05:02.373 --> 05:03.457
I'm right here.

05:04.292 --> 05:05.500
Please let me marry!

05:05.960 --> 05:07.210
There's no time.

05:07.211 --> 05:08.128
Hurry!

05:11.841 --> 05:14.058
So please, Kuma-san.

05:14.302 --> 05:16.887
I want to grant Michiru's wish!

05:17.305 --> 05:19.556
I, marry your daughter?

05:20.600 --> 05:23.602
Sure, we've been friends since we were children.

05:24.395 --> 05:25.645
But that's drastic!

05:26.070 --> 05:27.272
But please!

05:27.273 --> 05:28.445
Just the ceremony!

05:28.463 --> 05:30.275
She won't last long!

05:31.444 --> 05:32.611
I understand.

05:32.612 --> 05:35.572
I will come, for Michiru-chan.

05:38.368 --> 05:40.377
Hey, Kuma, is the article done?

05:40.703 --> 05:42.245
My sister's in a coma.

05:42.246 --> 05:43.330
I'm sorry!

05:43.873 --> 05:44.456
What?!

05:48.836 --> 05:49.878
Michiru-chan...

05:50.588 --> 05:53.048
<i>Kuma Onii-chan!</i>

05:59.347 --> 06:01.390
Wait for me, Michiru-chan.

06:03.643 --> 06:06.812
Mom, hasn't a man walked in yet?

06:07.522 --> 06:10.540
I'm sure a man who will surprise you will come.,

06:10.938 --> 06:11.552
Right?

06:11.758 --> 06:12.378
Yes.

06:14.028 --> 06:15.529
I guess someone is here.

06:15.947 --> 06:16.697
Come in.

06:23.037 --> 06:24.839
Are you Aotori Michiru-san?

06:25.164 --> 06:27.332
I'm a doctor named Black Jack.

06:28.251 --> 06:29.668
In this hospital?

06:31.504 --> 06:32.766
I'm  an outsider.

06:33.006 --> 06:35.298
I was asked by a doctor from here.

06:36.300 --> 06:38.385
Doctors are exceptions, right?

06:38.386 --> 06:39.094
No.

06:39.095 --> 06:40.262
This encounter was destined.

06:40.722 --> 06:41.638
Destined?

06:44.809 --> 06:46.268
Sorry I'm late.

06:46.728 --> 06:47.811
Who are you?

06:48.396 --> 06:51.231
Kuma Nii-chan, he's the man I'm going to marry.

06:51.983 --> 06:52.941
What?!

06:53.484 --> 06:54.901
Doctor,

06:54.902 --> 07:01.408
she asked the impossible, to marry
the first man who walked into this room.

07:02.660 --> 07:05.042
Impossible is right!

07:05.284 --> 07:07.122
And I'm the second?

07:07.749 --> 07:10.500
I'd like to marry Dr. Black Jack.

07:11.336 --> 07:13.587
I said the first man.

07:14.255 --> 07:17.007
I came here to operate on you.

07:17.508 --> 07:18.717
I won't recover, will I?

07:19.427 --> 07:22.054
I'll be the judge of that.

07:22.764 --> 07:24.348
Doctor are you married?

07:24.974 --> 07:26.099
That's not important now.

07:26.726 --> 07:27.601
It is important.

07:28.061 --> 07:31.980
I won't allow the operation if I can't marry you.

07:32.565 --> 07:33.648
Michiru-chan!

07:33.649 --> 07:35.901
Don't be ridiculous!

07:37.195 --> 07:38.320
I'm serious.

07:39.072 --> 07:41.114
I want to have a wedding before I die.

07:43.534 --> 07:44.618
Marriage is not a game.

07:46.120 --> 07:47.496
The operation will be useless.

07:48.164 --> 07:51.208
Most of all, the patient herself has given up all hope.

07:51.709 --> 07:52.551
Do you think so?

07:53.753 --> 07:58.674
I think she's putting all of her hope for life in the wedding.

08:00.301 --> 08:01.593
Hope for life?

08:02.512 --> 08:06.139
Doctor, this is her last selfish wish.

08:06.140 --> 08:07.460
Even if it's just an act...

08:07.809 --> 08:09.101
This is just make-believe?

08:09.435 --> 08:12.938
Doctor, I know it's rude to do this,

08:12.939 --> 08:14.856
but I'd like to thank you...

08:15.274 --> 08:17.275
I won't accept pocket change.

08:17.985 --> 08:20.862
Give me 50,000,000 as a dowry.

08:21.864 --> 08:23.365
50,000,000?!

08:23.449 --> 08:26.535
Just to have a make-believe wedding?!

08:26.953 --> 08:29.705
That includes her operation fee.

08:29.706 --> 08:32.165
The chance is low, but I will do my best.

08:33.501 --> 08:34.126
Um...

08:34.707 --> 08:36.067
Dr. Black Jack...

08:37.005 --> 08:40.882
It's the first time, even for me, that there's
been a wedding and an operation together.

08:42.969 --> 08:46.221
Do you know what marriage is?

08:46.639 --> 08:47.889
The meaning of husband and wife?

08:48.474 --> 08:49.099
Yes.

08:49.892 --> 08:54.157
Once you are married, you must trust your partner.

08:54.480 --> 08:55.647
You must, too.

08:56.149 --> 08:56.773
Okay?

08:57.400 --> 08:58.400
Okay.

08:59.193 --> 09:01.028
I will slash your body.

09:01.696 --> 09:03.405
I may tear it apart.

09:05.742 --> 09:06.742
I don't mind.

09:08.077 --> 09:10.468
Your cancer has spread to locations.

09:10.835 --> 09:13.415
We need to make 34 separate excisions.

09:14.250 --> 09:18.160
In other words, I will take away most of your organs.

09:18.629 --> 09:19.379
Okay.

09:19.922 --> 09:23.425
Depending on the organ, we may
transplant one from someone else,

09:23.801 --> 09:26.136
or implant artificial organs.

09:26.679 --> 09:27.471
Yes.

09:28.723 --> 09:29.931
Aren't you scared?

09:30.975 --> 09:33.727
I need to trust you, right?

09:34.520 --> 09:37.731
The operation is not guaranteed to be successful.

09:37.732 --> 09:38.690
Do you still not mind?

09:40.943 --> 09:42.194
Hurry up with the ceremony.

09:42.904 --> 09:44.446
Please tell so to Mom.

09:48.201 --> 09:51.065
Your daughter would like to talk about the wedding.

09:51.454 --> 09:52.245
Michiru!

09:55.375 --> 09:57.918
Hey! What in the world are you doing?!

09:57.919 --> 10:00.003
You don't know anything about Michiru-chan!

10:00.004 --> 10:00.712
And to marry her?!

10:01.255 --> 10:04.517
It will be a surgical operation with 18 incisions!

10:04.884 --> 10:07.386
If such a small act can give the patient some energy,

10:07.929 --> 10:09.888
I'll gladly take part in a make-believe wedding,

10:10.390 --> 10:12.147
A make-believe wedding?!

10:12.475 --> 10:13.934
Michiru-chan is serious!

10:14.852 --> 10:17.396
Then cheer her up yourself.

10:19.732 --> 10:24.528
If you can give her hope then
all I have to do is operate on her.

10:25.905 --> 10:26.822
Me?

10:32.578 --> 10:34.371
I can't...

10:38.084 --> 10:40.210
Doc!

10:40.211 --> 10:42.754
We'll have a big dinner tonight.

10:42.755 --> 10:43.799
I can't come home tonight.

10:44.048 --> 10:45.215
It'll be a major operation.

10:46.384 --> 10:47.634
Really?

10:48.011 --> 10:48.979
Sorry, Pinoco.

10:49.178 --> 10:50.628
Eat the dinner yourself.

10:51.806 --> 10:53.140
Dr. Black Jack.

10:54.684 --> 10:56.560
What was that voice?!

10:57.020 --> 10:58.103
That voice?

10:59.105 --> 11:00.313
She's the doctor here.

11:00.898 --> 11:02.232
Don't stay up too late.

11:02.233 --> 11:02.774
Hey, wait!

11:03.776 --> 11:06.486
Doctor, can you give me any advice?

11:09.240 --> 11:12.117
I sense that something is going on.

11:13.036 --> 11:14.911
Pinoco-chan!

11:17.790 --> 11:19.082
Isn't this cool?

11:19.083 --> 11:20.876
It's a news mountain bike.

11:21.044 --> 11:22.085
Cool!

11:22.086 --> 11:24.254
You're here at just the right time.

11:24.756 --> 11:28.425
Can you give me a ride to the
general hospital in the next town?

11:28.426 --> 11:29.509
I can't.

11:29.510 --> 11:31.595
Riding with two people is not safe.

11:31.596 --> 11:33.221
I need a ride!

11:33.848 --> 11:35.265
Please!

11:35.266 --> 11:36.516
Jeez...

11:37.060 --> 11:37.768
That's it!

11:38.978 --> 11:40.228
Let's go!

11:43.232 --> 11:45.150
Hurry! Hurry!

11:49.072 --> 11:52.316
Are you really going to have the wedding?

11:52.450 --> 11:54.576
I can't help it, with all that's been going on.

11:55.495 --> 11:56.620
This is it.

11:56.621 --> 11:57.996
What are we doing at a jewelry store?

11:58.956 --> 12:01.041
We need a ring for the wedding.

12:02.085 --> 12:05.396
I don't know what she would
like, so can you pick one for me?

12:05.713 --> 12:07.297
Do you need to do that much?

12:07.757 --> 12:08.298
Yes.

12:08.633 --> 12:13.762
I intend to complete the operation while the
anesthetic called hope is still effective.

12:16.557 --> 12:18.100
Would you like a ring?

12:18.101 --> 12:18.725
Yes.

12:19.143 --> 12:21.353
I think this one would match you well, ma'am.

12:23.523 --> 12:25.883
No, she would pick... this one.

12:29.612 --> 12:31.029
What are you doing with those?

12:31.489 --> 12:33.550
We will have the wedding in this room,

12:33.991 --> 12:36.618
so I'm going to decorate the room for it.

12:37.120 --> 12:38.036
I see.

12:41.290 --> 12:44.418
Michiru, I just got the wedding dress ready.

12:45.878 --> 12:47.343
Thank you, Daddy!

12:58.732 --> 13:00.858
We're finally here.

13:04.988 --> 13:06.656
This way, please.

13:07.741 --> 13:08.950
What's going on?

13:08.951 --> 13:11.160
It's as if there'll be a wedding.

13:11.161 --> 13:12.537
A wedding?!

13:12.538 --> 13:13.496
Pinoco!

13:14.915 --> 13:16.207
Why are you here?

13:16.917 --> 13:17.625
Hey!

13:17.626 --> 13:19.732
Could it, could it be you?!

13:19.962 --> 13:22.672
I am Doc's wife!

13:22.881 --> 13:26.050
I won't allow you to marry Doc!

13:26.385 --> 13:29.470
Hey, hey, she's just a doctor at this hospital.

13:29.596 --> 13:32.140
You like Doc, don't you?

13:32.141 --> 13:34.934
And that's why you're marrying him in the hospital, right?

13:35.269 --> 13:36.352
Oh, no,

13:36.854 --> 13:39.897
Dr. Black Jack is marrying someone else.

13:40.190 --> 13:41.941
Oh, thank goodness...

13:43.193 --> 13:45.945
Ohmigewdness!

13:55.080 --> 13:56.410
Pinoco-chan!

13:56.410 --> 13:57.498
Pinoco-chan!

13:58.375 --> 14:00.960
I must go now!

14:03.797 --> 14:05.548
Excuse me!

14:10.429 --> 14:13.389
Your wedding partner is me, Pinoco.

14:13.682 --> 14:16.476
Pinoco, this wedding is just make-believe.

14:16.894 --> 14:18.227
No!

14:18.270 --> 14:20.646
I'm your wife!

14:20.647 --> 14:22.774
Don't marry anyone else!

14:23.901 --> 14:25.072
Stop it, Pinoco.

14:25.277 --> 14:27.278
This isn't a game.

14:29.198 --> 14:30.239
Are you serious?

14:35.454 --> 14:39.030
Do you, Black Jack, take this woman to be your wife?

14:39.030 --> 14:43.377
Do you promise to build a healthy life with her
and love her for as long as you both shall live?

14:44.129 --> 14:45.004
I do.

14:45.506 --> 14:50.760
Do you, Aotori Michiru, promise
to become this man's good wife?

14:51.386 --> 14:53.513
Yes, I do.

14:58.727 --> 14:59.644
Damn...

15:07.694 --> 15:10.113
If you want to cry too, I'll let you use this.

15:11.115 --> 15:12.532
Now take the ring.

15:19.873 --> 15:20.957
How cute.

15:21.834 --> 15:25.419
Now they have been happily united.

15:25.921 --> 15:27.463
Congratulations, Michiru.

15:27.881 --> 15:28.923
You're so pretty.

15:29.591 --> 15:31.384
Thank you, Dad, Mom.

15:31.802 --> 15:33.052
I'm happy.

15:33.220 --> 15:35.513
Now, let's go to the operating room.

15:37.307 --> 15:37.673
Yes.

15:38.058 --> 15:39.142
Wait!

15:39.143 --> 15:40.143
Cheese!

15:41.550 --> 15:42.703
Operation in Progress

15:43.272 --> 15:45.398
Incisions will be made at the thyroid gland,

15:45.524 --> 15:48.985
rib number eight, right breast, right axilla,

15:49.044 --> 15:50.570
upper abdominal median line,

15:49.311 --> 15:51.851
That's impossible!

15:50.572 --> 15:53.323
second left lumber vertebra, left groin, and...

15:51.931 --> 15:53.271
To do all that all at once?

15:54.241 --> 15:56.325
We will start with the extraction from the thyroid gland.

15:56.994 --> 15:58.661
Continue the oxygen supply.

15:58.662 --> 15:59.812
Is the oscillograph reading okay?

16:00.122 --> 16:00.705
Yes.

16:08.088 --> 16:10.506
We will now move on to the right breast.

16:11.383 --> 16:12.675
Unbelievable!

16:12.676 --> 16:15.553
He finished the extraction from the
thyroid gland in just five minutes!

16:20.851 --> 16:23.478
Let's believe in Dr. Black Jack.

16:24.396 --> 16:25.396
Next.

16:25.397 --> 16:27.231
We will do the right axilla.

16:27.941 --> 16:31.068
He's serious about doing all of them.

16:36.325 --> 16:37.784
It's been three hours.

16:41.288 --> 16:43.706
Finished with 33 focus areas.

16:44.625 --> 16:46.292
One more left.

16:48.253 --> 16:49.224
Are you tired?

16:49.713 --> 16:51.714
Aren't you?

16:55.469 --> 16:57.099
Next, extract the rectum.

16:57.387 --> 16:58.971
We will make an artificial anus,

16:58.972 --> 17:01.349
However, we will raise the pelvis,

17:01.350 --> 17:03.059
and operate while keeping her on her back.

17:04.144 --> 17:05.561
We've never operated like that!

17:16.406 --> 17:17.740
Operation complete.

17:17.741 --> 17:18.950
I appreciate your support.

17:20.911 --> 17:21.869
Thank you.

17:29.211 --> 17:31.129
I have removed all focus areas.

17:33.632 --> 17:35.091
It's now all up to you.

17:36.677 --> 17:37.802
Yes.

17:38.303 --> 17:40.972
Thank you, doctor.

17:40.973 --> 17:42.765
Will Michiru be healthy now?

17:44.226 --> 17:46.727
Let's watch her recovery progress.

17:54.528 --> 17:55.903
Pinoco, where's breakfast?

17:56.447 --> 17:59.170
You're going to go see that woman again, aren't you?

17:59.408 --> 18:01.409
As your wife, that's unforgivable.

18:02.202 --> 18:03.536
She's my patient!

18:04.079 --> 18:06.038
Oh, yeah?

18:20.053 --> 18:21.345
It's been two weeks now.

18:21.847 --> 18:24.766
As far as I can tell from the X-ray images, it's looking good.

18:25.559 --> 18:29.270
Doctor, have you ever loved someone?

18:31.565 --> 18:35.860
I'm deeply in love for the first time in my life.

18:36.361 --> 18:39.071
He's the only man for me in the world.

18:39.865 --> 18:42.649
And he is standing in front of me and he married me.

18:43.368 --> 18:46.245
And he is standing in front of me and he married me.

18:47.080 --> 18:49.953
I like being appreciated for saving your life,

18:50.292 --> 18:52.335
but don't mix that up with romantic feelings.

18:52.961 --> 18:55.379
But I love you, doctor.

18:56.089 --> 18:58.966
If you walk away from my life,

18:59.635 --> 19:02.345
I can't continue to live.

19:03.430 --> 19:04.347
Don't say that!

19:04.807 --> 19:09.560
But I'm okay if l die as long as you are by my side.

19:10.145 --> 19:11.562
Don't be so selfish!

19:12.231 --> 19:14.023
Don't ever say such a thing!

19:14.024 --> 19:15.066
Doctor...

19:15.234 --> 19:17.755
Remember, you were supposed to die back then.

19:18.153 --> 19:21.239
But now you have just started your new life!

19:21.949 --> 19:24.575
Just when you're supposed to enjoy your new life,

19:24.576 --> 19:25.676
you want to die again?!

19:25.911 --> 19:26.994
How could you?!

19:29.248 --> 19:30.352
I'm sorry.

19:30.666 --> 19:32.625
But we got married.

19:33.001 --> 19:34.335
That was only make-believe.

19:34.920 --> 19:39.715
But we swore in front of a minister,
that we a would love each other for life.

19:40.843 --> 19:43.670
I'm not a man who should be loved.

19:44.012 --> 19:45.555
Forget about this.

19:47.224 --> 19:49.159
But I love you!

19:49.476 --> 19:50.917
And only you!

19:51.145 --> 19:51.978
Believe me!

19:52.396 --> 19:55.630
I only healed a patient as a doctor.

19:56.358 --> 19:57.483
Wait, doctor!

19:57.693 --> 20:01.487
I can't live on if you walk away!

20:02.990 --> 20:05.283
Put an end to such fantasies.

20:06.243 --> 20:08.077
Don't hide in your dream.

20:08.745 --> 20:10.371
Live with your dream!

20:25.053 --> 20:25.887
Kuma-san,

20:26.597 --> 20:28.111
Michiru-san is crying.

20:28.640 --> 20:29.974
She needs to be cheered up.

20:32.311 --> 20:35.396
I don't know anything about her.

20:56.335 --> 20:57.460
Dr. Black Jack.

21:03.092 --> 21:04.133
Michiru-san.

21:04.551 --> 21:05.885
You're from that time...

21:05.886 --> 21:09.347
I won't allow any more of these wedding games with Doc!

21:10.265 --> 21:13.333
Oh, I won't play that again.

21:13.727 --> 21:15.144
That's good, then.

21:18.982 --> 21:21.109
These drawings are nice.

21:23.403 --> 21:26.572
I draw illustrations for that children's magazine now.

21:26.907 --> 21:31.160
But eventually, I'd like to publish my own children's book.

21:31.161 --> 21:32.075
You can do it.

21:32.913 --> 21:33.913
I'm sure of it.

21:35.290 --> 21:36.332
You still have that?

21:37.376 --> 21:41.546
It's a precious ring given to me
by the man that saved my life.

21:44.591 --> 21:49.178
Doctor, I will be marrying Kuma-san next month.

21:50.431 --> 21:51.597
Congratulations.

21:56.019 --> 21:57.562
Thank you very much.

22:07.075 --> 22:19.030
I love you darling. If I can be united with you,

22:07.075 --> 22:19.030
daisukuyo anata to hitotsu ni nareru no nara

22:19.148 --> 22:24.147
I couldn't be happier...

22:19.148 --> 22:24.147
konna shiawase wa naiwa...

22:25.716 --> 22:31.185
I wanted to see you forever

22:25.716 --> 22:31.185
zutto aitakute mattetano

22:31.729 --> 22:37.187
I'm laying on the grill,

22:31.729 --> 22:37.187
ami no ue ni yasashiku nekasete

22:37.791 --> 22:40.276
being heated up by you,

22:37.791 --> 22:40.276
anata ni hoterasarete

22:40.485 --> 22:48.262
so much that I change color

22:40.485 --> 22:48.262
atashi wa iro ga kawarukurai

22:48.347 --> 23:00.116
I dress up with sparkly grains of decorations

22:48.347 --> 23:00.116
kirakira hikaru tsubu no kazari de oshare

23:00.324 --> 23:12.055
I love you darling. Please love me more and more...

23:00.324 --> 23:12.055
daisukiyo motto motto atashi wo aishite

23:12.295 --> 23:23.646
I love you darling. If I can be united with you,

23:12.295 --> 23:23.646
daisukiyo anata to hitotsu no nareru no nara

23:23.832 --> 23:28.753
I couldn't be happier

23:23.832 --> 23:28.753
konna shiawase wa naiwa...

23:28.981 --> 23:33.915
How does it taste?

23:28.981 --> 23:33.914
oaji wa ikaga?

23:45.056 --> 24:15.047
Missing Pinoco

23:45.793 --> 23:47.293
Are you a robber?

23:47.593 --> 23:49.010
I need money!

23:49.595 --> 23:51.012
Where are we going?!

23:51.013 --> 23:52.680
Was she kidnapped?

23:52.973 --> 23:59.020
Yes, I'm worried about you
being an unlicensed, albeit excellent surgeon.

24:00.314 --> 24:01.689
Do you smell Pinoco?

24:02.775 --> 24:06.069
Miss, do you want to go on a trip with me?

24:07.780 --> 24:09.989
I will see you at three o'clock.

24:10.574 --> 24:11.282
Pinoco!

24:11.825 --> 24:14.702
Next Karte - Missing Pinoco

24:16.163 --> 24:17.747
Karte NG

24:19.124 --> 24:20.833
This wedding is just make-believe.

24:20.834 --> 24:21.709
No!

24:21.960 --> 24:23.336
I'm your...

24:23.379 --> 24:24.670
What's this?!
